  "template_meta": {
    "blurb": "Collects a reagent from every spawn point in a zone, changing realm after each pass so the spawns are fresh.\n\nA Collect Reagent node only sees the reagents within render distance of where it scans from, so one node rarely covers a whole zone. Add or delete Collect Reagent nodes until every spawn point in the zone is in range of one, and keep the last one connected back to Change to next realm.",
